      "text": "Modern: inject() function\n\nprivate auth = inject(AuthService);\n\nWorks in components, directives,\npipes, guards, interceptors.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "inj1",
      "originalText": "Modern: inject() function\n\nprivate auth = inject(AuthService);\n\nWorks in components, directives,\npipes, guards, interceptors.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
