      "text": "Signal (modern)\n\ncount = signal(0)\n\nComponents read\ncount() directly.\nAngular auto-detects\nchanges. Best for\nAngular 17+.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p1",
      "originalText": "Signal (modern)\n\ncount = signal(0)\n\nComponents read\ncount() directly.\nAngular auto-detects\nchanges. Best for\nAngular 17+.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
