    {
      "id": "3RnnTP4aJSfF5SokdA-bZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 61.093963623046875,
      "y": 1275.625,
      "width": 297.81207275390625,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2563eb",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b09",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1739891958,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1515256054,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771965275045,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: What makes a service a Singleton?\n\nprovidedIn: 'root' tells Angular to create\nONE instance in the root injector.\nAll components share the SAME object.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq1",
      "originalText": "Q: What makes a service a Singleton?\n\nprovidedIn: 'root' tells Angular to create\nONE instance in the root injector.\nAll components share the SAME object.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KrmAd3JkVKXQ-z4x-ePkO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 449.62139892578125,
      "y": 1275.625,
      "width": 316.7572021484375,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1191220790,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1779415402,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771965275045,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: Can you have 2 instances of a service?\n\nYES. Add it to providers:[] in a component.\nThat component + its children get a\nFRESH instance, separate from root.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq2",
      "originalText": "Q: Can you have 2 instances of a service?\n\nYES. Add it to providers:[] in a component.\nThat component + its children get a\nFRESH instance, separate from root.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5g0GT05D5bxnBLHigR9pY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 848.8963928222656,
      "y": 1275.625,
      "width": 314.20721435546875,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#16a34a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1379688310,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1257400886,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771965275045,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: inject() vs constructor — which to use?\n\ninject() is the modern Angular 17+ way.\nWorks outside class constructors too\n(guards, interceptors as functions).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq3",
      "originalText": "Q: inject() vs constructor — which to use?\n\ninject() is the modern Angular 17+ way.\nWorks outside class constructors too\n(guards, interceptors as functions).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qLhT8puxh4Wdn-o0JXVGH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52.393890380859375,
      "y": 1416.25,
      "width": 315.21221923828125,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d97706",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 766312630,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1667824682,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771965275045,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: Where should you subscribe -- service or\ncomponent?\n\nComponent. It manages lifecycle.\nService should return raw Observable.\nService subscribing = memory leak risk.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq4",
      "originalText": "Q: Where should you subscribe -- service or component?\n\nComponent. It manages lifecycle.\nService should return raw Observable.\nService subscribing = memory leak risk.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LMO-gPtoubB5lAhFxN-K7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 477.8291015625,
      "y": 1416.25,
      "width": 260.341796875,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 754416118,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 550744950,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771965275045,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: What is tree-shaking in services?\n\nIf you never inject a service,\nAngular removes it from the bundle.\nOnly works with providedIn: 'root',\nnot with providers array.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq5",
      "originalText": "Q: What is tree-shaking in services?\n\nIf you never inject a service,\nAngular removes it from the bundle.\nOnly works with providedIn: 'root',\nnot with providers array.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vBWH_d-JcoVCnJFZQSp8p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 860.3939819335938,
      "y": 1416.25,
      "width": 291.2120361328125,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0d9488",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1730202422,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1309402858,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771965275045,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: BehaviorSubject vs Signal for state?\n\nSignal: Angular 17+, simpler, built-in CD.\nBehaviorSubject: RxJS, more powerful,\nbetter for complex async streams.\nBoth valid -- know WHEN to use each.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq6",
      "originalText": "Q: BehaviorSubject vs Signal for state?\n\nSignal: Angular 17+, simpler, built-in CD.\nBehaviorSubject: RxJS, more powerful,\nbetter for complex async streams.\nBoth valid -- know WHEN to use each.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
